# EMI detector / harmonic estimator Vitis components: keep the hls4ml firmware and test vectors, not the work dirs
!HLS_PRJ/emi_detector/firmware/
!HLS_PRJ/emi_detector/tb_data/
!HLS_PRJ/harmonic_estimator/firmware/
!HLS_PRJ/harmonic_estimator/tb_data/
